              "180 000",
              "Budget Impact (US$)",
              "Year",
              "Scenario A (base package + syphilis + NG/CT testing) = Total cost US$ 433 054 (2021–2025)",
              "Scenario B (base package + syphilis) = Total cost US$ 336 419 (2021–2025)",
              "2022",
              "2023",
              "2024",
              "2025",
              "Source: Pan American Health Organization, 2021."
